---
description: Check OK and configured evidence gates
alwaysApply: true
---

Use `ok check-ok --dry-run` to inspect a proposed side-check artifact, or
`--scaffold-only` to create one explicitly. Review uses the shared bound service
and the repository's reviewer/checklist settings. A mechanical pass is not an
independent semantic review. Preserve non-pass stamps and producer/reviewer roles.

Use configured verification, ISR and adversarial-freeze requirements when the
accepted task invokes them. Model labels do not mandate extra review loops or
authorize paid provider calls. API execution needs explicit opt-in. No review
engine generates NEXT: publish any accepted successor through bound next-write
with current context and expected whole-file digest, then read it with ok next.
